IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `mlr-core`
IMPORT `mlr5-sch6b`

-- TESTS for Schedule 6B (Changes in Control of Registered Cryptoasset Businesses), lines 3391-3543.
-- Expected values are written from the text before the run.  Percentages are chosen at each side of each step the
-- text names (20, 30, 50, 10).  A rule limited by its own wording answers NOTHING outside the limit; a definition
-- given with "means", and a section 181-183 test given with "if", answer JUST FALSE where the text's own words say no.

§ `Local helpers (not law)`

-- A holding of a given percentage before and after.
GIVEN b IS A NUMBER
      a IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `sch 6B holding`
`sch 6B test: holding from b to a` MEANS
    `sch 6B holding` WITH
        `the percentage before the step` IS b
        `the percentage after the step` IS a

§ `Paragraph 5 -- interpretation (lines 3538-3543)`

-- registered cryptoasset business: an exchange provider on the register
#ASSERT (`sch 6B para 5 the business is a registered cryptoasset business` WITH `the business is a cryptoasset exchange provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(1)` IS TRUE, `the business is included in the register maintained by the FCA under regulation 54(1A)` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- an exchange provider not on the register: 'means' closes the definition
#ASSERT (`sch 6B para 5 the business is a registered cryptoasset business` WITH `the business is a cryptoasset exchange provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(1)` IS TRUE, `the business is included in the register maintained by the FCA under regulation 54(1A)` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- a custodian wallet provider is not an exchange provider, so is not within this definition even if on the register (FORK S6B-F1)
#ASSERT (`sch 6B para 5 the business is a registered cryptoasset business` WITH `the business is a cryptoasset exchange provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(1)` IS FALSE, `the business is included in the register maintained by the FCA under regulation 54(1A)` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- cryptoasset business: an exchange provider or a custodian wallet provider
#ASSERT (`sch 6B para 5 the business is a cryptoasset business` WITH `the business is a cryptoasset exchange provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(1)` IS TRUE, `the business is a custodian wallet provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(2)` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`sch 6B para 5 the business is a cryptoasset business` WITH `the business is a cryptoasset exchange provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(1)` IS FALSE, `the business is a custodian wallet provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(2)` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`sch 6B para 5 the business is a cryptoasset business` WITH `the business is a cryptoasset exchange provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(1)` IS FALSE, `the business is a custodian wallet provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(2)` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the two pointers at regulation 14A
#ASSERT `sch 6B para 5 the term has the meaning given by` `sch 6B para 5 cryptoasset exchange provider` EQUALS "regulation 14A(1)"
#ASSERT `sch 6B para 5 the term has the meaning given by` `sch 6B para 5 custodian wallet provider` EQUALS "regulation 14A(2)"
-- the definition inserted into section 191G, in each paragraph: an exchange provider OR a custodian wallet provider, on the register
#ASSERT (`sch 6B para 2(v)(ii) the business is a registered cryptoasset business within section 191G` WITH `the business is a cryptoasset exchange provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(1)` IS TRUE, `the business is a custodian wallet provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(2)` IS FALSE, `the business is included in the register maintained by the FCA under regulation 54(1A)` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`sch 6B para 2(v)(ii) the business is a registered cryptoasset business within section 191G` WITH `the business is a cryptoasset exchange provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(1)` IS FALSE, `the business is a custodian wallet provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(2)` IS TRUE, `the business is included in the register maintained by the FCA under regulation 54(1A)` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`sch 6B para 2(v)(ii) the business is a registered cryptoasset business within section 191G` WITH `the business is a cryptoasset exchange provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(1)` IS TRUE, `the business is a custodian wallet provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(2)` IS TRUE, `the business is included in the register maintained by the FCA under regulation 54(1A)` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`sch 6B para 2(v)(ii) the business is a registered cryptoasset business within section 191G` WITH `the business is a cryptoasset exchange provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(1)` IS FALSE, `the business is a custodian wallet provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(2)` IS FALSE, `the business is included in the register maintained by the FCA under regulation 54(1A)` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`sch 6B para 4(r)(ii) the business is a registered cryptoasset business within section 191G` WITH `the business is a cryptoasset exchange provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(1)` IS TRUE, `the business is a custodian wallet provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(2)` IS FALSE, `the business is included in the register maintained by the FCA under regulation 54(1A)` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`sch 6B para 4(r)(ii) the business is a registered cryptoasset business within section 191G` WITH `the business is a cryptoasset exchange provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(1)` IS FALSE, `the business is a custodian wallet provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(2)` IS TRUE, `the business is included in the register maintained by the FCA under regulation 54(1A)` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`sch 6B para 4(r)(ii) the business is a registered cryptoasset business within section 191G` WITH `the business is a cryptoasset exchange provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(1)` IS TRUE, `the business is a custodian wallet provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(2)` IS TRUE, `the business is included in the register maintained by the FCA under regulation 54(1A)` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`sch 6B para 4(r)(ii) the business is a registered cryptoasset business within section 191G` WITH `the business is a cryptoasset exchange provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(1)` IS FALSE, `the business is a custodian wallet provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(2)` IS FALSE, `the business is included in the register maintained by the FCA under regulation 54(1A)` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Paragraphs 1 and 3 -- which set of modifications applies (lines 3392-3394, 3493-3495)`

#ASSERT `sch 6B para 1 the date before which the business must have been included in the register` EQUALS (Date 25 10 2027)
#ASSERT `sch 6B para 3 the date on or after which the business must have been included in the register` EQUALS (Date 25 10 2027)
-- paragraph 1: included before 25 October 2027, Part 12 not otherwise applying
#ASSERT (`sch 6B para 1 Part 12 of FSMA applies to the business with the modifications specified in paragraph 2` WITH `the business is a cryptoasset exchange provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(1)` IS TRUE, `the business is included in the register maintained by the FCA under regulation 54(1A)` IS TRUE, `the date on which the business was included in the register` IS (Date 24 10 2027), `Part 12 of FSMA would otherwise apply to the business` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`sch 6B para 1 Part 12 of FSMA applies to the business with the modifications specified in paragraph 2` WITH `the business is a cryptoasset exchange provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(1)` IS TRUE, `the business is included in the register maintained by the FCA under regulation 54(1A)` IS TRUE, `the date on which the business was included in the register` IS (Date 1 1 2020), `Part 12 of FSMA would otherwise apply to the business` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 25 October 2027 itself is not 'before': paragraph 1 does not apply (outside the date the text fixes: JUST FALSE, FORK S6B-F4), paragraph 3 does
#ASSERT (`sch 6B para 1 Part 12 of FSMA applies to the business with the modifications specified in paragraph 2` WITH `the business is a cryptoasset exchange provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(1)` IS TRUE, `the business is included in the register maintained by the FCA under regulation 54(1A)` IS TRUE, `the date on which the business was included in the register` IS (Date 25 10 2027), `Part 12 of FSMA would otherwise apply to the business` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`sch 6B para 3 Part 12 of FSMA applies to the business with the modifications specified in paragraph 4` WITH `the business is a cryptoasset exchange provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(1)` IS TRUE, `the business is included in the register maintained by the FCA under regulation 54(1A)` IS TRUE, `the date on which the business was included in the register` IS (Date 25 10 2027), `Part 12 of FSMA would otherwise apply to the business` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`sch 6B para 3 Part 12 of FSMA applies to the business with the modifications specified in paragraph 4` WITH `the business is a cryptoasset exchange provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(1)` IS TRUE, `the business is included in the register maintained by the FCA under regulation 54(1A)` IS TRUE, `the date on which the business was included in the register` IS (Date 26 10 2027), `Part 12 of FSMA would otherwise apply to the business` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the day before: paragraph 3 does not apply (outside the date: JUST FALSE)
#ASSERT (`sch 6B para 3 Part 12 of FSMA applies to the business with the modifications specified in paragraph 4` WITH `the business is a cryptoasset exchange provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(1)` IS TRUE, `the business is included in the register maintained by the FCA under regulation 54(1A)` IS TRUE, `the date on which the business was included in the register` IS (Date 24 10 2027), `Part 12 of FSMA would otherwise apply to the business` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- outside the date, and Part 12 would otherwise apply: the date decides first
#ASSERT (`sch 6B para 1 Part 12 of FSMA applies to the business with the modifications specified in paragraph 2` WITH `the business is a cryptoasset exchange provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(1)` IS TRUE, `the business is included in the register maintained by the FCA under regulation 54(1A)` IS TRUE, `the date on which the business was included in the register` IS (Date 25 10 2027), `Part 12 of FSMA would otherwise apply to the business` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`sch 6B para 3 Part 12 of FSMA applies to the business with the modifications specified in paragraph 4` WITH `the business is a cryptoasset exchange provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(1)` IS TRUE, `the business is included in the register maintained by the FCA under regulation 54(1A)` IS TRUE, `the date on which the business was included in the register` IS (Date 24 10 2027), `Part 12 of FSMA would otherwise apply to the business` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Part 12 would otherwise apply: the paragraphs are limited to a business 'to which Part 12 of FSMA would not otherwise apply'
#ASSERT (`sch 6B para 1 Part 12 of FSMA applies to the business with the modifications specified in paragraph 2` WITH `the business is a cryptoasset exchange provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(1)` IS TRUE, `the business is included in the register maintained by the FCA under regulation 54(1A)` IS TRUE, `the date on which the business was included in the register` IS (Date 24 10 2027), `Part 12 of FSMA would otherwise apply to the business` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`sch 6B para 3 Part 12 of FSMA applies to the business with the modifications specified in paragraph 4` WITH `the business is a cryptoasset exchange provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(1)` IS TRUE, `the business is included in the register maintained by the FCA under regulation 54(1A)` IS TRUE, `the date on which the business was included in the register` IS (Date 26 10 2027), `Part 12 of FSMA would otherwise apply to the business` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- not on the register, or a custodian wallet provider only (paragraph 5): outside both paragraphs
#ASSERT (`sch 6B para 1 Part 12 of FSMA applies to the business with the modifications specified in paragraph 2` WITH `the business is a cryptoasset exchange provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(1)` IS TRUE, `the business is included in the register maintained by the FCA under regulation 54(1A)` IS FALSE, `the date on which the business was included in the register` IS (Date 24 10 2027), `Part 12 of FSMA would otherwise apply to the business` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`sch 6B para 3 Part 12 of FSMA applies to the business with the modifications specified in paragraph 4` WITH `the business is a cryptoasset exchange provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(1)` IS TRUE, `the business is included in the register maintained by the FCA under regulation 54(1A)` IS FALSE, `the date on which the business was included in the register` IS (Date 26 10 2027), `Part 12 of FSMA would otherwise apply to the business` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`sch 6B para 1 Part 12 of FSMA applies to the business with the modifications specified in paragraph 2` WITH `the business is a cryptoasset exchange provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(1)` IS FALSE, `the business is included in the register maintained by the FCA under regulation 54(1A)` IS TRUE, `the date on which the business was included in the register` IS (Date 24 10 2027), `Part 12 of FSMA would otherwise apply to the business` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`sch 6B para 3 Part 12 of FSMA applies to the business with the modifications specified in paragraph 4` WITH `the business is a cryptoasset exchange provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(1)` IS FALSE, `the business is included in the register maintained by the FCA under regulation 54(1A)` IS TRUE, `the date on which the business was included in the register` IS (Date 26 10 2027), `Part 12 of FSMA would otherwise apply to the business` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- the gather
#ASSERT (`sch 6B paras 1 and 3 which set of modifications applies` WITH `the business is a cryptoasset exchange provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(1)` IS TRUE, `the business is included in the register maintained by the FCA under regulation 54(1A)` IS TRUE, `the date on which the business was included in the register` IS (Date 24 10 2027), `Part 12 of FSMA would otherwise apply to the business` IS FALSE) EQUALS `sch 6B the modifications in paragraph 2`
#ASSERT (`sch 6B paras 1 and 3 which set of modifications applies` WITH `the business is a cryptoasset exchange provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(1)` IS TRUE, `the business is included in the register maintained by the FCA under regulation 54(1A)` IS TRUE, `the date on which the business was included in the register` IS (Date 25 10 2027), `Part 12 of FSMA would otherwise apply to the business` IS FALSE) EQUALS `sch 6B the modifications in paragraph 4`
#ASSERT (`sch 6B paras 1 and 3 which set of modifications applies` WITH `the business is a cryptoasset exchange provider within the meaning of regulation 14A(1)` IS TRUE, `the business is included in the register maintained by the FCA under regulation 54(1A)` IS TRUE, `the date on which the business was included in the register` IS (Date 25 10 2027), `Part 12 of FSMA would otherwise apply to the business` IS TRUE) EQUALS `sch 6B paragraphs 1 and 3 do not say that Part 12 applies`
