§ `Paragraph 2(d) -- section 181, acquiring control (lines 3398-3407)`

-- (a)(i): a beneficial owner of the business
#ASSERT (`sch 6B para 2(d) section 181 the person acquires control over the business` WITH `the person would become a beneficial owner of the business within regulation 5 or 6` IS (JUST TRUE), `the person would become a beneficial owner of a parent undertaking of the business within regulation 5 or 6` IS (JUST FALSE), `the percentage of the shares in the business that the person would hold` IS 0, `the percentage of the shares in the parent undertaking that the person would hold` IS 0, `the percentage of the voting power in the business that the person would hold` IS 0, `the percentage of the voting power in the parent undertaking that the person would hold` IS 0, `the person would otherwise hold shares or voting power in the business or its parent undertaking as a result of which the person is able to exercise significant influence over the management of the business` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (a)(ii): a beneficial owner of a parent undertaking
#ASSERT (`sch 6B para 2(d) section 181 the person acquires control over the business` WITH `the person would become a beneficial owner of the business within regulation 5 or 6` IS (JUST FALSE), `the person would become a beneficial owner of a parent undertaking of the business within regulation 5 or 6` IS (JUST TRUE), `the percentage of the shares in the business that the person would hold` IS 0, `the percentage of the shares in the parent undertaking that the person would hold` IS 0, `the percentage of the voting power in the business that the person would hold` IS 0, `the percentage of the voting power in the parent undertaking that the person would hold` IS 0, `the person would otherwise hold shares or voting power in the business or its parent undertaking as a result of which the person is able to exercise significant influence over the management of the business` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
